    "bulkers": "As a record-breaking summer heatwave is currently affecting large parts of Europe this \nmonth, \"the heat is on\" also in the s+p market. This week, we recorded a total of 20 deals at firm \nlevels, comprising 2 Newcastlemax, 1 post-panamax, 2 Kamsarmax, 3 Ultramax, 4 Supramax, and 8 \nHandysize bulk carriers. For a detailed review and additional information regarding these transactions, \nkindly refer to our \"representative sales\" section.",
    "demolition": "Bangladesh maintains a cautiously stable position as local shipyards approach full \ncapacity. Pakistan remains stable at elevated levels. In contrast, the Indian market continue to decline \ndue to the rainy season, while the Turkish market has strengthened. For an overview of demolition \nmarket rates, please check our comprehensive demometer below:"
